The test exercises character 160 (0xA0) which is exactly the boundary of this new range — this is the edge case being fixed.

## Step 4: Compatibility

The change is additive — it handles previously unhandled special characters. No signature changes, no API changes. The only risk would be if the `newcount += 4` value is wrong compared to the rest of the method's special character handling, but this pattern is consistent with how 4-hex-digit unicode escapes would be handled elsewhere.

